---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="After Your Boot Camp Payment | HVAC Training Solutions"
  description="What happens after paying for HVAC Boot Camp: Ron confirms payment, enrolls you in Moodle, and sends your account details by email."
  indexable={false}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner narrow-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">HVAC Boot Camp</p>
      <h1>Thank you. <span>Here are your next steps.</span></h1>
      <p>If you completed your PayPal payment, Ron will confirm it and manually set up your account for the current 27-module course in Moodle. Visiting this page alone does not confirm a payment or create course access.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="page-shell purchase-steps">
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Watch for your account email.</strong><p>After Ron enrolls you, look for an email with the subject “HVAC Training Solutions: New user account.” It includes the course login location, your username, and a temporary password.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Check spam if you do not see it.</strong><p>The current enrollment instructions ask you to allow up to 30 minutes for access. Because setup is manual, contact Ron if your account email has not arrived after that time.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Sign in and begin.</strong><p>Use the details in the account email to enter the course at <a href="https://hvactraining.academy/">hvactraining.academy</a>. You can also <a href="https://calendly.com/hvactrainingsolutions/online-hvac-training-call">check availability for a welcome call with Ron</a>.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="purchase-help">
        <h2>Need help with your access?</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com?subject=HVAC%20Boot%20Camp%20course%20access">hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com</a> with the name and email used at checkout. Do not send your PayPal password, card number, or temporary course password.</p>
        <a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com?subject=HVAC%20Boot%20Camp%20course%20access">Ask Ron for help</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .purchase-steps{max-width:820px}
  .purchase-steps ol{list-style:none;counter-reset:steps;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:1rem}
  .purchase-steps li{counter-increment:steps;position:relative;padding:1.4rem 1.5rem 1.4rem 4.5rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:#fff}
  .purchase-steps li::before{content:counter(steps);position:absolute;left:1.4rem;top:1.3rem;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2rem;height:2rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue-dark);font-weight:800}
  .purchase-steps li strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:1.25rem}
  .purchase-steps li p,.purchase-help p{color:var(--soft);line-height:1.6}
  .purchase-steps a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .purchase-help{margin-top:1.3rem;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:18px;background:var(--blue-pale)}
  .purchase-help h2{margin:0;color:var(--ink)}
  @media(max-width:480px){.purchase-steps li{padding:1.2rem 1.2rem 1.2rem 3.8rem}.purchase-steps li::before{left:1rem;top:1.1rem}}
</style>
